7294: # (D3, F03-2, F04-4) The coordinator's identity, resolved ONCE at the start of a run (a panel member
7295: # and a detached background take their run's - never inferred again downstream): the value of
7296: # CODEX_CONSULT_COORDINATOR (optional) parsed by the reviewer matcher (ConvertFrom-ReviewerMatcher)
7297: # - `<provider> :: <model>` [` [<engine>]`], a roster position `#<n>` or a provider label - and the
7298: # host hint (Get-CoordinatorHostHint: markers, else the install path; no warning comes from it).
